<title>POLAND: Zywiec revises up 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Zywiec revises up 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zywiec SA preliminary results for 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			19.47  vs  34.81</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  13.48  vs  43.68</p>
<p>    net profit				 8.07  vs  27.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Piwowarskie w Zywcu Zywiec SA. Earlier the company reported net profit of eight million zlotys and sales of 265.7 million. @</p>
<p>    net sales				367.99  vs 296.61</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 144.16  vs 107.21</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00  vs   0.02</p>
<p>    income tax				 5.40  vs  16.56</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs   0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.68  vs  81.77</p>
<p>    financial costs			  8.67  vs  72.95</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
